{
  "$schema_version": 1,
  "_doc": "Icon standard of Zuehlke MCP, read by <skill>/kit/make_icons.py (always pass --spec, --src and --out: from .labview/conventions/ the paths do not resolve against the product folder). The rules are in icons.md beside this file; the names are those of requirements/02-specification.md. classes: owner key (the class folder name, a flat folder, the top-level owner or a library owner) -> banner (the 02 abbreviation, max 7), web-safe colour, lib_glyph. libs: .lvlib icons. no_template: classes entries without a .lvclass; library_owners: owners whose .lvlib is the template of their VIs; flat_folders: first-level src folders drawn flat. overrides: owner -> VI file -> lib_glyph + glyph. rules: ordered name rules (match contains|prefix|suffix|equals; first: true runs before the built-in Read/Write/Send/Do rules). palette, lib_glyphs (10x10) and glyphs (16x16) are copied unchanged from the pilot's spec (requirements/assets/icons/icon-spec.json); the rules were rewritten in phase 01d to the 02 member names (camelCase; specific patterns before short ones, so closeConnection before -close and createEvents/createResources/createFolder before -create), using only glyphs the spec or the engine already has. planned: VIs not built yet (--include-planned).",
